{"dur": 29.15, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "hook", "text": "Un poteau. Deux méthodes.", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 2.73, "words": [{"w": "Un", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "poteau.", "t": 1.391}, {"w": "Deux", "t": 1.837}, {"w": "méthodes.", "t": 2.156}]}, {"id": "defi", "text": "Trente sur trente, quatre niveaux, cadres resserrés en tête et en pied.", "t0": 3.11, "t1": 7.444, "words": [{"w": "Trente", "t": 3.11}, {"w": "sur", "t": 3.549}, {"w": "trente,", "t": 3.801}, {"w": "quatre", "t": 4.24}, {"w": "niveaux,", "t": 4.68}, {"w": "cadres", "t": 5.183}, {"w": "resserrés", "t": 5.622}, {"w": "en", "t": 6.251}, {"w": "tête", "t": 6.439}, {"w": "et", "t": 6.753}, {"w": "en", "t": 6.942}, {"w": "pied.", "t": 7.13}]}, {"id": "main", "text": "À la main : le fût, les barres, les cadres zone par zone, les recouvrements, les cotes. Trente minutes.", "t0": 8.244, "t1": 14.826, "words": [{"w": "À", "t": 8.244}, {"w": "la", "t": 8.38}, {"w": "main", "t": 8.584}, {"w": ":", "t": 8.923}, {"w": "le", "t": 8.991}, {"w": "fût,", "t": 9.194}, {"w": "les", "t": 9.466}, {"w": "barres,", "t": 9.737}, {"w": "les", "t": 10.212}, {"w": "cadres", "t": 10.484}, {"w": "zone", "t": 10.959}, {"w": "par", "t": 11.298}, {"w": "zone,", "t": 11.569}, {"w": "les", "t": 11.909}, {"w": "recouvrements,", "t": 12.18}, {"w": "les", "t": 13.13}, {"w": "cotes.", "t": 13.401}, {"w": "Trente", "t": 13.809}, {"w": "minutes.", "t": 14.284}]}, {"id": "auto", "text": "Avec CivRebar : tu donnes la section, la hauteur et les armatures.", "t0": 15.206, "t1": 19.6, "words": [{"w": "Avec", "t": 15.206}, {"w": "CivRebar", "t": 15.55}, {"w": ":", "t": 16.167}, {"w": "tu", "t": 16.236}, {"w": "donnes", "t": 16.442}, {"w": "la", "t": 16.922}, {"w": "section,", "t": 17.128}, {"w": "la", "t": 17.678}, {"w": "hauteur", "t": 17.883}, {"w": "et", "t": 18.433}, {"w": "les", "t": 18.639}, {"w": "armatures.", "t": 18.913}]}, {"id": "civrebar", "text": "Quelques secondes. Et les zones critiques sont déjà resserrées.", "t0": 19.98, "t1": 23.278, "w